pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: sec-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 32, 44, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: 思源宋体
      bold: true
      text: "08"
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [112, 34, 700, 30]
    content:
      style: "$pageTitle"
      text: 系统演示
  - elementId: head-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 76, 840, 1.5]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  # 左：Web 界面截图
  - elementId: ui-img
    elementType: image
    bounds: [60, 104, 440, 275]
    src: media/demo_ui.png
    fit: {mode: cover}
    crop: {bottom: 0.18}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "#D8CFC0"}
  - elementId: ui-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 386, 440, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [center, top]
      text: 图 8　Web 演示界面（上传 MRI → 输出诊断概率与注意力图）
  # 右：真实推理输出
  - elementId: out-img
    elementType: image
    bounds: [528, 104, 372, 120]
    src: media/demo_output.png
    fit: {mode: contain}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "#D8CFC0"}
  - elementId: out-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [528, 230, 372, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [center, top]
      text: 图 9　一次真实推理：脑膜瘤，模型输出概率 99.7%（未经校准，不等于诊断正确率）
  - elementId: demo-flow-heading
    elementType: text
    bounds: [528, 266, 372, 22]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      text: 现场演示流程
  - elementId: demo-flow
    elementType: text
    bounds: [528, 296, 372, 108]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12.5
      text: |
        <p>① 运行 <span style="background-color:$pale">python app/app.py</span> 启动系统</p>
        <p>② 浏览器中上传任意一张脑部 MRI</p>
        <p>③ 实时输出四类概率 + Grad-CAM 热力图</p>
        <p>④ CPU 单张推理约 1 秒，可现场互动</p>
  - elementId: demo-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 420, 440, 60]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12
      text: |
        <p><strong>系统完整性</strong>：数据 → 训练 → 评估 → 可视化 → 部署五环全部打通，非单点脚本；界面内置四类示例图像，一键试跑。演示模型为 ResNet18 全连接头（内部测试 94.1%），与 Hopfield 记忆头的指标分开报告。</p>
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 512, 400, 14]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 9
      text: 脑肿瘤 MRI 图像分类辅助诊断系统 · 认知科学大作业
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 512, 40, 14]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 9
      align: [right, top]
      text: "08"
